"Ash is a CNH Talent Development faculty member who runs the Superlatives, the S-rank club."
"He wears many rings, though only a couple are real magical tools."
"He argues classes should compete for S-rank floor time in the MPE gym."
"He teaches Coursing I: tall, dressed in black, shoeless, blunt, with very sugary coffee."
"He is a powerful S-rank Adjuster who makes terrain only he can see."
"He wears near shoulder-length hair held back by a thin black band."
"He picks which Coursing teams run from their strategies and vibes, and prefers S-ranks."
"He says there's nothing special about hard work; nobody reaches the peak without luck."
"From its name he deduced that Alden's entrusters can't take back what he preserves."
